bin/
# `go build ./cmd/dragon` with no -o drops the binary in the repository root,
# which is how a 23MB darwin executable reached main once. Ignore it by name
# as well as by directory.
/dragon
coverage.out
dragon.sarif
dragon.md

# Scan state: the baseline snapshot and the EPSS/KEV caches. The snapshot is
# per-machine and per-branch, and committing it would make one developer's
# local scan the baseline everybody else is measured against.
.dragon/
